<title>USA: Hoboken, N.J., to detail waterfront development.</title>
<headline>Hoboken, N.J., to detail waterfront development.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hoboken, N.J., and the Port Authority of New York and New Jersey plan to hold a news conference on Thursday about the city's major waterfront redevelopment project, officials familiar with the project said Tuesday.</p>
<p>Some of the ideas that have been proposed for the project over the years include a &quot;mixed-use&quot; community, with office and residential development.</p>
<p>Hoboken officials said they could not offer more details.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the Port Authority declined to comment.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
